    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-019",
      "source_id": "slide-04",
      "page": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "线性回归假设输出与特征之间呈线性关系：ŷ = w·x + b。",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-020",
      "source_id": "slide-04",
      "page": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "它是最基本的回归方法。",
      "location": "Bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-021",
      "source_id": "slide-04",
      "page": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "最小二乘法：通过最小化预测值与真实值之差的平方和来求解参数 w 和 b。",
      "location": "Bullet 3",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-022",
      "source_id": "slide-05",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "线性回归的求解",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-023",
      "source_id": "slide-05",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "正规方程：直接求出参数的闭式解，要求 X^T·X 可逆。",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-024",
      "source_id": "slide-05",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "梯度下降：沿损失函数的负梯度方向迭代更新参数。",
      "location": "Bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-025",
      "source_id": "slide-05",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "学习率决定每次更新的步长。",
      "location": "Bullet 3",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-026",
      "source_id": "slide-06",
      "page": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "梯度下降的三种形式",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-027",
      "source_id": "slide-06",
      "page": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "content": "形式: 批量梯度下降 | 每次更新使用的样本: 全部训练样本 | 特点: 稳定，但每次计算量大",
