      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-029",
      "source_id": "slide-06",
      "page": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "content": "形式: 小批量梯度下降 | 每次更新使用的样本: 一小批样本（如 32 个） | 特点: 两者的折中，最常用",
      "location": "Table row 3 (小批量梯度下降)",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-030",
      "source_id": "slide-07",
      "page": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "逻辑回归",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-031",
      "source_id": "slide-07",
      "page": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "尽管名字中有“回归”，逻辑回归是一种用于二分类的方法。",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-032",
      "source_id": "slide-07",
      "page": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Sigmoid 函数 σ(z) = 1 / (1 + e^(−z)) 将任意实数映射到 (0, 1) 区间，输出可解释为样本属于正类的概率。",
      "location": "Bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-033",
      "source_id": "slide-07",
      "page": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "逻辑回归的决策边界是线性的。",
      "location": "Bullet 3",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-034",
      "source_id": "slide-07",
      "page": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "训练时使用交叉熵损失函数。",
      "location": "Bullet 4",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-035",
      "source_id": "slide-08",
      "page": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "多分类问题",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-036",
      "source_id": "slide-08",
      "page": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "逻辑回归本身只能处理二分类，可以通过两种方式扩展到多分类：",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-037",
      "source_id": "slide-08",
      "page": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "一对其余（One-vs-Rest）：为每个类别训练一个二分类器，将该类与其余类别区分。",
      "location": "Bullet 1, sub-bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-038",
      "source_id": "slide-08",
      "page": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Softmax 回归：逻辑回归在多分类问题上的直接推广，输出每个类别的概率。",
      "location": "Bullet 1, sub-bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-039",
      "source_id": "slide-09",
      "page": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "k 近邻（kNN）",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-040",
      "source_id": "slide-09",
      "page": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "预测时，找出与新样本距离最近的 k 个训练样本：",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-041",
      "source_id": "slide-09",
      "page": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "分类：k 个邻居多数投票",
      "location": "Bullet 1, sub-bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-042",
      "source_id": "slide-09",
      "page": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "回归：取 k 个邻居标签的平均值",
      "location": "Bullet 1, sub-bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-043",
      "source_id": "slide-09",
      "page": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "kNN 是一种惰性学习方法：训练阶段仅存储训练样本，不构建显式模型，计算主要发生在预测阶段。",
      "location": "Bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-044",
      "source_id": "slide-10",
      "page": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "kNN 的关键问题",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-045",
      "source_id": "slide-10",
      "page": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "k 值较小：模型对噪声敏感，容易过拟合；k 值较大：决策边界过于平滑，容易欠拟合。",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-046",
      "source_id": "slide-10",
      "page": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "常用的距离度量：欧氏距离、曼哈顿距离。",
      "location": "Bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-047",
      "source_id": "slide-10",
      "page": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "特征的尺度会影响距离计算，使用 kNN 前通常需要对特征进行缩放。",
      "location": "Bullet 3",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-048",
      "source_id": "slide-11",
      "page": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "朴素贝叶斯",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-049",
      "source_id": "slide-11",
      "page": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "基于贝叶斯定理：P(y | x) = P(x | y) · P(y) / P(x)，由先验概率和似然计算后验概率。",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-050",
      "source_id": "slide-11",
      "page": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "“朴素”指的是条件独立假设：给定类别时，各特征之间相互独立。",
      "location": "Bullet 2",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-051",
      "source_id": "slide-11",
      "page": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "实际数据中这一假设往往不成立，但朴素贝叶斯在文本分类等任务中通常仍能取得不错的效果。",
      "location": "Bullet 3",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-052",
      "source_id": "slide-11",
      "page": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "例：根据邮件中出现的词语判断是否为垃圾邮件。",
      "location": "Bullet 4",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-053",
      "source_id": "slide-12",
      "page": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "朴素贝叶斯的三种变体",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-054",
      "source_id": "slide-12",
      "page": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "content": "变体: 高斯朴素贝叶斯 | 适用的特征: 连续特征（假设服从正态分布） | 典型场景: 数值型数据",
      "location": "Table row 1 (高斯朴素贝叶斯)",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-055",
      "source_id": "slide-12",
      "page": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "content": "变体: 多项式朴素贝叶斯 | 适用的特征: 计数特征（如词频） | 典型场景: 文本分类",
      "location": "Table row 2 (多项式朴素贝叶斯)",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-056",
      "source_id": "slide-12",
      "page": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "content": "变体: 伯努利朴素贝叶斯 | 适用的特征: 二值特征（出现 / 未出现） | 典型场景: 短文本分类",
      "location": "Table row 3 (伯努利朴素贝叶斯)",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-057",
      "source_id": "slide-12",
      "page": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "拉普拉斯平滑：在计数上加 1，避免训练中未出现的特征使整个概率为 0。",
      "location": "Note below table",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-058",
      "source_id": "slide-13",
      "page": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "决策树",
      "location": "Title",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-059",
      "source_id": "slide-13",
      "page": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "以树形结构进行决策：内部节点对某个特征进行测试，分支对应测试结果，叶节点给出预测结果。",
      "location": "Bullet 1",
      "certainty": "high"
    },
    {
